{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116397","id":3293269774,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ES08O","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116397.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116397/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116397/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116397/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/af09f81dc401a0d84c6b6eabf322694c4d40b935","number":116397,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GPUParticles2D trails not aligning to velocity","user":{"login":"heyomidk","id":11528303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTI4MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11528303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk","html_url":"https://github.com/heyomidk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes godotengine/godot#89449\r\n\r\nHello! This is my first contribution to Godot, feedback is welcome. \r\n\r\n### Problem \r\nWhen GPUParticles2D trails are used with radial/orbit/directional velocities, the trails don't align to the direction of motion.  \r\n\r\nThis was caused by the engine forcibly applying `PARTICLES_TRANSFORM_ALIGN_Y_TO_VELOCITY` when trails were enabled, which overwrote the process shader's velocity alignment with an incomplete cached velocity.  As a result, the radial/orbit/directional velocity components were ignored when determining alignment.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nRemove the forced `PARTICLES_TRANSFORM_ALIGN_Y_TO_VELOCITY` in `GPUParticles2D::set_trail_enabled`.\r\nTrails now respect the process shaders `Align Y` particle flag, making the trail behavior consistent with GPUParticles3D.\r\n\r\n### Breaks compatibility\r\nProjects relying on automatic y-alignment for GPUParticles2D trails will need to enable the `Align Y` particle flag on their process shader when previously they didn't.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n- Verified that 2D trails can now align with particles when they have animated velocities, and that toggling the flag turns alignment on/off for trails.\r\n- Here's how the fix behaves in my minimal repro project https://github.com/heyomidk/godot-minrepo-89449:\r\n\r\n![fix-89449](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8c3a61e-770c-4aed-9772-3174af4a8b4d)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4442850752,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNCFwA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:particles","name":"topic:particles","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-17T08:36:50Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T12:57:24Z","closed_at":"2026-02-21T11:48:56Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"e8e763fa84f4f21be061687c927a5301d11df5bd","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"heyomidk:fix-89449","ref":"fix-89449","repo":{"id":1159710892,"node_id":"R_kgDORR_IrA","name":"godot","full_name":"heyomidk/godot","owner":{"login":"heyomidk","id":11528303,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTI4MzAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11528303?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk","html_url":"https://github.com/heyomidk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heyomidk/followers","following_url":"https://